{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":112379,\"title\":\"Fucked Up\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Fucked Up is Raging Stallion doing what Raging Stallion does best: non-stop, man-on-man action that will keep a smile on your dick for weeks! Fucked Up showcases intense, hardcore, dirty deeds in a sex club where there are no limits to what can – and what does – happen. These testosterone-filled, aggressive men take out their sexual tension on each other with the Raging Stallion cameras there to catch every single minute. Watch hairy, beefy, tattooed and pierced new Exclusive Superstar-in-the-Making Derek Parker in his debut performances as he is joined by a group of studs who bring it, and bring it dirty. Opening with an orgy that will have you drooling, and closing with an explosive group fuckathon, Fucked Up is an unbridled winner!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sHepveAULIEvcgOMARBbUgD2pwP.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/geC2kTGAGC6NzAEaEqzUzarVSEL.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":2012,\"runtime\":107,\"genres\":[],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Bruno Bond\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":222688,\"name\":\"Bruno Bond\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cXpwdpBvXMYATBVw5ZcOBpGSA0L.jpg\"},{\"id\":333734,\"name\":\"Tony DiMarco\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7moaM4hp5DlFnEvgRx9CCc2t5gQ.jpg\"},{\"id\":222879,\"name\":\"Steve Cruz\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e7QfGHmq6uCs8FNG9gELyciWo3w.jpg\"},{\"id\":193177,\"name\":\"Chris Ward\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4jIJJyGvFouc3ywG666ApAP7sGW.jpg\"},{\"id\":1054699,\"name\":\"Derek Parker\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mMGoWEdUbqlLLzFHk1d0QwjYpM