friend, he manages to find his own path.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":283716,\"title\":\"The Whore with the Chainsaw\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wX7482tPk5L5swDEKu2Lta88VzN.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A love story, a love triangle that gets soiled with blood with the arrival of a fourth character: a serial killer who collects vaginas. Lesbian couple is chased by lover betrayed in the areas of Weird. Blood and sex in the tradition of the 80's Boca do Lixo films with eschatological scenes and total cinematographic metalanguage.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10630,\"title\":\"Führer Ex\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/khDisRXmVZeNeB46d98SZ33h1Qt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/m3jrSepRoM8BlYZyiuKUzq5LD8n.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Ingo Hasselbach, whose parents were Communist Party members in East Germany during his childhood, has lived at both ends of the political seesaw. The question of how people reach a change of heart is a profound one; Hasselbach describes the external forces that led to his founding Germany's first neo-Nazi political party and the internal ones that led him away from it five years later.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":509840,\"title\":\"Mondo Homo: A Study of French Gay Porn in the '70s\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8xce458AC0RmzPBKkZlKNccFtDN.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p9GePx5MPwB9WehZ4Y1qaCkmTBp.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Between 1975 and 1983 a new kind of film could be seen in French cinema : home-grown gay pornography. The films were shot in 16mm and most of them were passed and given certificates by the CNC (National Cinema Centre). They were screened in a small number of Parisian cinemas dedicated to gay pornographic films : Le Dragon, La Marotte and Le Hollywood Boulevard as well as several in the provinces. They were essentially the work of three production companies : Les Films de La Troïka (Norbert Terry), AMT Productions (Anne-Marie Tensi) and Les Films du Vertbois (principally Jacques Scandelari). The genre met an untimely end with the advent of video, the last being made in 1983 \\\"Mon ami, mon amour (My friend, my lover)\\\". Since then, gay pornography has not been screened in French cinemas. This film is the result of five years of painstaking research and investigation. It features extensive interviews with the directors and actors illustrated by numerous extracts from their films.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":475930,\"title\":\"Knife+Heart\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/Aodlp3TH6FBti9igUCt8f5KS7Nb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o6rSSDdXkQRGCYKTkwiFjWG7qov.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the summer of 1979, gay porn producer Anne sets out to film her most ambitious film yet, but her actors are picked off, one by one, by a mysterious killer.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Romance\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":347870,\"title\":\"Slash\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hmrhRg05zoR16hGeSfiMKIRpf6y.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nIB8kKXNukQEqPKB8nsfcemAShs.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Freshman Neil's Vanguard stories are all he cares about...until he meets the older Julia, who pushes him to put his own fan fic online. When the website's moderator takes a special interest in Neil's work, it opens up a whole new universe.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":17731,\"title\":\"The Fluffer\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jYKeDJ0PgVBoSUVq4aXkXrapsjA.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pNUVUFyf5UTAaaoh9k7UK6FXmez.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Self-effacing, boyish Sean moves to LA to pursue a career in movies but finds it tougher than he imagined. He stumbles onto porn star Johnny Rebel - a handsome, muscled dream of men and women alike - who awakens Sean’s deep obsession.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":27069,\"title\":\"The Raspberry Reich\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2sZ5RvohgzMfHNDGmw2AwwutVPu.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aDG5Bm9WhH7f0rLBAzy781r64J4.jpg\",\"rating\":5.6,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Gudrun has modeled her amateur German terrorist group after the 1970s Red Army Faction (Baader-Meinhof Gang). She attempts to imitate her heroes by kidnapping the son of a wealthy industrialist and hopes to negotiate leftist demands from the father. When Gudrun’s not spouting leftist verses (including during a hilariously brilliant fuck session), she’s trying to convince her all-male gang to abandon their heterosexuality, which she believes is the result of mass delusion.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Action\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":83907,\"title\":\"Underwater Love\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rXFiV8H24WZxNefyy0bNUkrEPlZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2YwPPqcXatbb5TV7x31dvOp8my1.jpg\",\"rating\":5.2,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"35-year-old Asuka works in a lakeside fish factory. She’s about to be married to her boss, Taki, but one day, she encounters a kappa – a water sprite found in Japanese folklore – and learns that the creature is in fact the reborn form of Aoki, an old crush who’d drowned when they were 17.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Romance\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"AFuLZEgOyKs\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"czoXw4QSUio\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\